ubscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bread-big/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bread-big/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bread-big/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bread-big/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bread-big/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-15T16:48:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-15T16:48:44Z","body":"> Set this to `Compatibility`, restart the editor and try to reproduce this bug again.\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbd20e19-f9f6-4ae5-9bbb-1ba0cf2f8d8a)\n\nAfter a simple troubleshooting, I found that Godot cannot run on the independent graphics card and must be specified to run on the integrated graphics card, otherwise a black screen and freeze will occur.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661000663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3064060198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102890#issuecomment-3064060198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102890","id":3064060198,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62odkm","user":{"login":"brennennen","id":8002418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDI0MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8002418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen","html_url":"https://github.com/brennennen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brennennen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T22:24:13Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T22:24:13Z","body":"It looks like issues surrounding the intel arc line of gpus and godot/vulkan are pretty common.\n\nIf compatibility mode is not a solution for you, then it looks like some people have had some luck updating their drivers, can you confirm you have up to date intel arc graphic drivers?\n\nThere is also the windows command line tool \"vkia\" that can provide some diagnostic information around your machine and it's vulkan support. Can you try opening your command prompt/powershell and seeing if you happen to have this tool installed and what the output is?\n\nExample:\n```txt\nPS C:\\Users\\brennen> vkvia\nVIA_INFO:    SDK Found! - Will attempt to run tests\nVIA_INFO:       Attempting to run vkcube.exe in C:\\VulkanSDK\\1.3.268.0\\Bin\nVIA_INFO:           Command-line: vkcube.exe --c 100 --suppress_popups\nVIA_INFO:           Command-line: vkcube.exe --c 100 --suppress_popups --validate\nSUCCESS: Vulkan analysis completed properly using Vulkan 1.4\n```\n\nOther advice I see in other tickets is to see if you have the same issues in linux if you happen to have a dual boot setup on your laptop and are willing to use linux instead of windows.\n\nLastly, it looks like some intel arc gpu windows users are having some success switching to directx instead of vulkan. I just tried this on my machine with the latest mainline to try and provide instructions on how to do this and everything I tried crashed for me though, so it seems a bit experimental and I won't be able to provide instructions. If you'd like to give this a shot, then let me know and I'll try to find someone willing to provide instructions.\n\nGodot intel arc with vulkan related issues that have interesting discussions and potential trouble shooting information that might be helpful:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90228\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74243\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90277","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3064060198/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794781899","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102890#issuecomment-3794781899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102890","id":3794781899,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iL8bL","user":{"login":"Askanio234","id":22379331,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzc5MzMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22379331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234","html_url":"https://github.com/Askanio234","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Askanio234/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"